# Tier-opponent probe: 1P -> MIKE -> Crawler -> Dragster -> NOW PLAYING -> race.
# Run with a pre-boot SRAM whose Crawler/MIKE medal cell selects the tier
# (driven by tools/probe_tier_opponents.py). Documented input only.
until 009F == D7 3600
wait 60
press a 2
until 009F == 3C 1200
wait 60
press a 2
until 009F == 6D 1200
wait 60
press a 2
until 009F == F6 1200
wait 60
dump tier-track
press a 2
until 009F == 16 1200
wait 60
dump tier-card
press a 2
until 0313 == 01 1800
wait 90
dump tier-race
quit
